    "problemStatement": "The power of a number indicates how many times that number is multiplied by itself.\nYou are given a function,\nint CheckPowerOfTwo(int n);\nint CheckPowerOfTwo(int n);\nstatic int CheckPowerOfTwo(int n);\nstatic int CheckPowerOfTwo(int n);\ndef CheckPowerOfTwo(n):\nfunction CheckPowerOfTwo(n){}\nfunction CheckPowerOfTwo(n){}\nThe function accepts an integer 'n' as its argument. Implement the function to determine if it is a\npower of 2. If 'n' is a power of 2, then return the power, else return -1.\nAssumption: n > 0",
